{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114801","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114801","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1511480101:0":{"text":"你、你有两条尾巴！","source_cn":"你、你有两条尾巴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEA2365C5181C81E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511480102:0":{"text":"这么说，你是猎血节的勇士！","source_cn":"这么说，你是猎血节的勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9E48F2ED3B88D9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511480103:0":{"text":"哇啊——你是怎么赢得猎血节的？！","source_cn":"哇啊——你是怎么赢得猎血节的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04685A069087B947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511480104:0":{"text":"他们都说丛林里的野兽非常凶恶，只有你能打败它们，其他人都战死了。这是真的吗？","source_cn":"他们都说丛林里的野兽非常凶恶，只有你能打败它们，其他人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182CC975459A621A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511480105:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511480106:0":{"text":"你们相信神明会杀死自己的信徒吗？","source_cn":"你们相